                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4491b429-644c-3b6b-8485-0ad423f982f9",
                                        "entry_id": "a9d8abf0-d865-3ac0-8bc4-99a4646894ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The free selection before survey of crown land in some Australian colonies under land legislation introduced in the 1860s. ᵂᵖ"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f97561b-fa32-4e6e-8c6a-624b821c2230",
                                                "sense_id": "4491b429-644c-3b6b-8485-0ad423f982f9",
                                                "text": "Our selection adjoined a sheep-run on the Darling Downs, and boasted […] a forest of box-trees, a stock-yard, and six acres under barley[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3d85d76-b411-319f-a4da-19f479d60537",
                                        "entry_id": "a9d8abf0-d865-3ac0-8bc4-99a4646894ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The free selection before survey of crown land in some Australian colonies under land legislation introduced in the 1860s. ᵂᵖ",
                                            "A plot of land, or farm, thus selected."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d9178d7-0382-341b-b2b5-c0b3a7b264aa",
                                        "entry_id": "a9d8abf0-d865-3ac0-8bc4-99a4646894ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The stage of a genetic algorithm in which individual genomes are chosen from a population for later breeding. ᵂᵖ"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6fb0778d-39bd-3c52-a9b9-68df96947b72",
                                        "entry_id": "a9d8abf0-d865-3ac0-8bc4-99a4646894ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of natural selection."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d246030d-20bf-4233-b535-b445231b5e02",
                                                "sense_id": "6fb0778d-39bd-3c52-a9b9-68df96947b72",
                                                "text": "Slow though the process of selection may be, if feeble man can do much by his powers of artificial selection, I can see no limit to the amount of change, to the beauty and infinite complexity of the coadaptations between all organic beings, one with another and with their physical conditions of life, which may be effected in the long course of time by nature’s power of selection."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c38bf55-3809-426b-aa86-018103bee432",
                        "source_entry_id": "32bcabc7-44c7-3595-abf9-9e57ad3cad6f",
                        "source_sense_id": "abded018-cbeb-3347-9489-083d539a53fa",
                        "target_lang_word": "sélection",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sélection",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25135d3d-2d6b-3465-9def-408985555f4a",
                                        "entry_id": "29cc2573-e830-3a5d-a56f-8f21dc9ce0b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de choisir ou résultat de ce choix."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "356dab8d-4049-418b-8cc7-774773f34ece",
                                                "sense_id": "25135d3d-2d6b-3465-9def-408985555f4a",
                                                "text": "On me signale de toutes parts les maux qu’engendrent ces mariages d’argent par quoi s’opère entre les sexes une sélection à rebours substituant de hideux calculs à cet enthousiasme courageux qui est le propre des jeunes amours."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c257459a-a03b-4864-bdb2-33f9a300ad1a",
                                                "sense_id": "25135d3d-2d6b-3465-9def-408985555f4a",
                                                "text": "Le scandale, c’est qu’un système déconsidéré par son obésité, son impotence et sa doctrine puisse ainsi continuer de sévir. La faute majeure fut aux origines, dans la déviation égalitariste, de supprimer la sélection et l’émulation."
                                            },
